      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-c6e4125a-5a09-41a2-87c1-e7f1c054dbbe-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 5px; border: none;">
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;">Thank you for attending our Capital Budget Town Hall. Your participation will help shape the future of the City of Columbus.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;"> </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;">To help us improve future Capital Budget Town Halls, we need your feedback. Please take a moment to complete our brief survey about your Capital Budget Town Hall experience. Your feedback is valuable in helping us better serve the residents of Columbus.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;"> </p>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr><td align="center" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe6ey9_cp-zmE7UGpq4zGEQVefk4YaDt6NU5iTzz-_d32XGow/viewform?usp=header&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/07/11980123/surveyasset-6_original.png" style="width: 156px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Red button. Text: Survey" width="156" height="39"></a></td></tr></table>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 0px;">For more information about the 2025 Capital Budget and for a budget breakdown, please visit the Department of Finance <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/Government/Departments/Finance-and-Management/Capital-and-Debt-Management?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">webpage</a>.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;"> </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 0px;">Questions? Please email Chris Suel at <a href="mailto:SCSuel@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00529B;">SCSuel@columbus.gov</a></p>
